{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12703","headline":"登白云亭 · 元结","name":"登白云亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出门见南山，喜逐松径行。\n穷高欲极远，始到白云亭。\n长山绕井邑，登望宜新晴。\n州渚曲湘水，萦回随郡城。\n九疑千万峰，嵺嵺天外青。\n烟云无远近，皆傍林岭生。\n俯视松竹间，石水何幽清。\n涵映满轩户，娟娟如镜明。\n何人病惛浓，积醉且未醒。\n与我一登临，爲君安性情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}